  "change": {
    "problem": "Immediate BUSY on a shared guard held by a preempted task can discard a completed BMP publication and skip a heartbeat. bmpinst_step advances its sequence even when shared publication returns BUSY.",
    "resolution": "Three acquisition attempts and at most two one-ms tk_dly_tsk requests allow the holder to finish. Same-task recursion returns BUSY immediately. No blocking or I/O is added inside the guard.",
    "limits": "Retry count is bounded; scheduler latency can extend wall time. Exhausted contention still returns BUSY. This is not a hard real-time guarantee.",
